      'Scoring example: Card points won in tricks using standard Briscola values: ace 11, three 10, king 4, queen 3, jack 2, and all other cards worth 0. Each deal contains 120 card points. Play several deals and add the card points from tricks; the first player to reach the agreed cumulative target (commonly 121 or 151 points) wins the game..',
